#: gift_economy/gift_circles/templates/gift_circles/email/coming.txt:20
#: gift_economy/gift_circles/templates/gift_circles/email/guest_coming.html:13
#: gift_economy/gift_circles/templates/gift_circles/email/guest_coming.txt:18
