#: gift_economy/gift_circles/templates/gift_circles/email/guest_confirm.html:3
#: gift_economy/gift_circles/templates/gift_circles/email/guest_confirm.txt:3
#: gift_economy/gift_circles/templates/gift_circles/guest_confirm.html:13
