#: gift_economy/gift_circles/templates/gift_circles/email/tour_invitation.txt:19
msgid "Happy giving!"
msgstr "¡A disfrutar regalando!"

#: gift_economy/gift_circles/templates/gift_circles/email/invitation.html:9
#: gift_economy/gift_circles/templates/gift_circles/email/invitation.txt:15
msgid "People sit in a circle and share what they wish for and what they can give. Things, time, skills, knowledge, contacts. Nothing is bought or sold."
msgstr "La gente se sienta en círculo y comparte lo que desea y lo que puede dar. Cosas, tiempo, habilidades, conocimientos, contactos. Nada se compra ni se vende."

#: gift_economy/gift_circles/templates/gift_circles/email/invitation.html:9
#: gift_economy/gift_circles/templates/gift_circles/email/invitation.txt:15
msgid "Strangers often leave as neighbours who help each other."
msgstr "A menudo, desconocidos se despiden como vecinos que se ayudan."

#: gift_economy/gift_circles/templates/gift_circles/email/invitation.html:13
#: gift_economy/gift_circles/templates/gift_circles/email/invitation.txt:19
#, python-format
msgid "%(name)s gave us your address for this gift-circle only. Not coming? Tell us, and we delete it:"
msgstr "%(name)s nos dio tu dirección solo para este círculo de regalos. ¿No vienes? Dínoslo y la borramos:"

#: gift_economy/gift_circles/templates/gift_circles/email/reminder.html:3
#: gift_economy/gift_circles/templates/gift_circles/email/reminder.txt:3
#, python-format
msgid "Tomorrow is the gift-circle %(title)s, hosted by %(host)s."
msgstr "Mañana es el círculo de regalos %(title)s, organizado por %(host)s."

#: gift_economy/gift_circles/templates/gift_circles/email/reminder.html:7
#: gift_economy/gift_circles/templates/gift_circles/email/reminder.txt:8
msgid "Others who come have what you wish for, or wish for what you have. Bring it along, so it can change hands there:"
msgstr "Otras personas que vienen tienen lo que deseas, o desean lo que tienes. Tráelo, así puede cambiar de manos allí:"

#: gift_economy/gift_circles/templates/gift_circles/email/reminder.html:12
#: gift_economy/gift_circles/templates/gift_circles/email/reminder.txt:12
msgid "See what the others bring:"
msgstr "Mira lo que traen los demás:"

#: gift_economy/gift_circles/templates/gift_circles/email/reminder.html:17
#: gift_economy/gift_circles/templates/gift_circles/email/reminder.txt:18
