msgid "Your wishes and offers that found nobody today stay on ecobasa. They keep finding people near you."
msgstr "Tus deseos y ofertas que hoy no encontraron a nadie se quedan en ecobasa. Siguen encontrando gente cerca de ti."

msgid "The whole Giftsheet"
